  "32dfa20e-9fa7-49d6-a132-4ee07651c6f9"],
 " is the degree of the first key with a nonzero value."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"d0c8da1d-0def-4a4c-b89a-c5877b22addc"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Values that are all zero, keys of different degrees, and keys that are not \
basis elements give ",
